+immediateRecaller crushed the mind. The suspected mechanism: a missed direct throw embeds behind the target, so an
+instant recall is a free second shot. That is the SPEC's "immediate recall dominates" failure mode. But named scripts
+are not a best-response search, and the bots may just dodge badly. Settle it properly.
